                     nri_cpu_balloons role owns cpusets. Nothing emitted here.
     kubelet-static  kubelet static CPU manager gives Guaranteed-QoS pods
                     exclusive whole cores.
     best-effort     no pinning, but still reserve CPUs for system daemons.

   NOTE: kubelet_reserved_cpus (reservedSystemCPUs) is intentionally NOT set
